"{\n  \"AND\": {\n    \"left\": {\n      \"AND\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"AND\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"FEV1 >= 80% or FEV1 < 20% of predicted value post-bronchodilator.\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"FEV1/SVC >= 70%\"\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"No history of lung transplant.\"\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"No lung surgery within the past two years.\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"Not on any thoracic surgery waiting list.\"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"right\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"End of last exacerbation >= 6 weeks prior to screening/re-screening visit.\"\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"No clinically significant intercurrent illnesses (except for respiratory or liver disease secondary to AAT deficiency).\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"Well-controlled, chronic diseases could possibly be included after consultation with the treating physician and the sponsor.\"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"right\": {\n      \"AND\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"raw_text\": \"No active smoking during the last 12 months from screening date.\"\n        },\n        \"right\": {\n          \"OR\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"Not pregnant or lactating.\"\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"Woman of child-bearing potential taking adequate contraception deemed reliable by the investigator.\"\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}"